            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "For future reference: at least one issue here was that `(require(\"nvim-tree.api\").close())` is executed immediately, i.e. during `require('mini.sessions').setup()` call, when it should be wrapped in `function() ... end` to be a function hook that gets executed when it is needed.",
